Graphocalypse

You - player is a DOT that has only one goal - survive
In game player fights math enemies using custom designed math functions. 
Weapon itself is a graph of the function defined. Weapons can have different types of fire.
They also can have modifiers. Player initially has set of just basic functions and operations.
When they progress, they can open more advanced functions that will be added to The Whiteboard of Functions
Gameplay is infinite and all maps are generated at a runtime randomly. Expected support for mods and SDK.
When all math functions are collected, player can buff the weapon with modifiers (expand modifier slots).
Modifier slots are infinitely expandable but the more complex combination is, the more advanced mobs in the locations there will be.

